 *
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Instrument: MGC (M30)</li>
 *   <li>Archetype: MOMENTUM (BOTH)</li>
 *   <li>Long Signal: MACD(5, 50)[0] &gt; 0 & Rising AND LinRegSlope(14)[1] &gt; +0.40 * ATR</li>
 *   <li>Short Signal: MACD(5, 50)[0] &lt; 0 & Falling AND LinRegSlope(14)[1] &lt; -0.40 * ATR</li>
 *   <li>Entry Type: Stop Breakout at Highest/Lowest(40)[1] ± 0.86 × ATR(14) (Valid 4 bars)</li>
 *   <li>Exit Rules: SL: 1.4 × ATR(14) | PT: 3.7 × ATR(14) | Trail: 2.4 × ATR | Time Exit: 62 bars</li>
